msgid "Algerian"
msgstr "アルジェリア"

#: data/nation/algerian.ruleset:4
msgid "?plural:Algerians"
msgstr "アルジェリア人"

#: data/nation/algerian.ruleset:6
msgid ""
"Algeria is an Arabic nation in North Africa. It is historically inhabited by "
"the Berber people."
msgstr ""
"アルジェリアは北アフリカのアラブ国家です。歴史的にはベルベル人が住んでいま"
"す。"

